msgid "APM Power Wiring Example"
msgstr "APM 供电接线示例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:350
#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:394
#: 3928f79168444c529998f5cd2d3de59a 465a6548d04c4a7ab3c5d4f3870310d6
#: 5562af7922ba4642abb6d087e0695b32 613da6e5bf014a7e986aaa28f3784215
#: 7bb23b43af6a4abb92778d76fc04fafa 916d7cd67d964fdb848d1b66eec666b6
#: bf2218178b3f432aa7eb6ace677e2b95 c225102d016245b3b09941ef58c9d42d
#: e7919c5826c74a01aa24cf37e4a60427 f6d6dc5369b7405fa537b9f39685c180
msgid ""
"Do not exceed Abs MAX input voltages when connecting power supply or you "
"will damage your board."
msgstr "连接电源时请勿超过绝对最大输入电压，否则将损坏电路板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:360
#: 14ff490cc4374c2db745454f4ecd83d6 9a210418df4d4b89ae68975adeeaf820
#: e67e7c5c2d854001978b67b468738bd6 f4b4eb9b1cf549c39dd44e1b7cfe6d2a
#: fae973c4fc3b48e8a9e66e053d69f8b1
msgid ""
"On the bench, you'll probably be powering the board via your USB cable while"
" you set it up and test it. But in your aircraft, you'll need to power it "
"with your on board power system, which is usually your LiPo battery going "
"through an ESC or the Power Module. In the case of a multicopter, this can "
"come through your Power Distribution Board (PDB), which will break out the "
"5V output from the one of the electronic speed controls (ESCs) or the Power "
"module which is wored directly to the battery."
msgstr ""
"在桌面调试时，您可能通过 USB 线为电路板供电进行设置和测试。但在飞行器上，您需要使用机载电源系统供电，通常是通过 ESC 或电源模块的 LiPo "
"电池。对于多旋翼，这可以通过电源分配板（PDB）实现，PDB 将从某个 ESC 或直接接电池的电源模块输出 5V 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:369
#: 0c9c43ca86eb403baf623eeb807d0f4f 6eef460b30b94398a73055800204413c
#: a92f28cf0a24483e9ee183a2359a8677 b85ced24f0284f85b3f6ea2cff82f31f
#: d8569666ffb04c4aad5001e76efb9517
msgid ""
"In the picture below, the red and black wires are the 5b    m hV power cable"
" coming from a PDB. You can plug them into any two pins along the 5V and "
"Ground (middle and outer) rows of pins on APM 2.5's Output side. The other "
"cable, which in this case is a four-wire cable with orange and white wires "
"for a quadcopter, is the signal cable to the PDB, which are the wires that "
"APM 2.5 will use to command each of the ESCs."
msgstr ""
"在下图中，红色和黑色导线是来自 PDB 的 5V 电源线。可以将其插入 APM 2.5 输出侧 5V "
"和地（中间和外侧）引脚排上的任意两个引脚。另一根线缆在本例中是四芯线，橙色和白色导线用于四旋翼，是连接到 PDB 的信号线，APM 2.5 "
"通过这些线发出对每个 ESC 的控制命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:376
#: 28bd6a50a9804a14bbb9844ad8fc12be 553d23058f6f481cb1395e2a69cdaeb7
#: 5ad93f3a244349c5b07e38397350ff53 a03beb1b5d36462296e400bb21ff1a1b
#: a5b56cb587b8482ea049ce576e2c7824
msgid ""
"The picture below is of APM 2; but the concept is applicable to APM 2.5."
msgstr "下图为 APM 2 的示例，但概念同样适用于 APM 2.5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:381
#: 02957e4692a04619be7ae4de1570ece9 0589081773df4a189f693050326269d2
#: 19a9743f3cbf419c903c1141d7cb749e 37dbdba45cff4067a208c8e15a3a9eb3
#: cefcd1c6797240c0b6192d0281a68a0e
msgid ""
"It's also possible to power APM 2.5 from two separate sources, one powering "
"the RC system on the input side, and the other powering the output side "
"(servos or ESCs). This is determined by a jumper on the JP1 pins (see "
"below). If the jumper is on, which is the factory default, the board is "
"powered from the OUTPUT rail or the USB. If the jumper is off, the board is "
"powered from the INPUT rail, but the OUTPUT rail will need its own power "
"source. This configuration is used if you want to have two separate power "
"sources in your aircraft, one powering the servos and the other powering the"
" electronics. The ideal input voltage is 5.37v +/-0.0v and may not be "
"provided by a typical ESC."
msgstr ""
"APM 2.5 也可以使用两路独立电源供电，一路为输入侧的 RC 系统供电，另一路为输出侧（舵机或 ESC）供电。这由 JP1 "
"引脚上的跳线决定（见下文）。如果跳线已安装（出厂默认），电路板从输出排或 USB "
"取电。如果跳线断开，电路板从输入排取电，但输出排需要自行供电。如果您希望飞行器中有两路独立电源，一路为舵机供电，另一路为电子设备供电，就需要此配置。理想输入电压为"
" 5.37V ±0.0V，普通 ESC 可能无法满足此要求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:397
#: 128e739036054b76afa8081af4ff1a33 8a0194e843664f29a6a2c220b2e6f774
#: cb6c114eb86448a798a383c2a0cf9e32 ecfcbe064a2b46138ff7c1d37d25da8e
#: ef49acc607a840c88589c4bf74eda282
msgid ""
"In some cases it may be a good idea to set the input voltage slightly above "
"the median (but below the maximum) to account for possible voltage drops "
"during momentary high current events."
msgstr "在某些情况下，将输入电压略微设置在中间值以上（但低于最大值）是个好主意，以应对瞬时大电流事件可能导致的电压下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:401
#: 01dec9aad129487baa61253b26d54f2d 4fa504556e944477a487e9b2829e81aa
#: 7d2daf3832334aa8bee537dc54db8793 cdace5b464bc4a5facb824725ac542eb
#: e692e07962994b249b853c5a22d71592
msgid ""
"The APM2.5 by itself draws relatively little current (200ma range) and a "
"power source capable of providing 300 - 500ma will provide plenty of margin."
" However, if servos or other power consuming devices are being driven by the"
" same power source you must consider the power requirements for those "
"devices as well and provide plenty of margin to prevent disastrous \"brown-"
"outs\". For instance, a single digital servo can easily draw 1-5 amps "
"depending on its size and performance. (Note: ESCs do not consume power from"
" the APM) If you experience spurious resets or other odd behavior it is most"
" likely due to noisy or insufficient power to the APM. As with all logic "
"boards, electrical noise from the motors, servos, or other high current "
"devices on the power source can cause unpredictable behavior."
msgstr ""
"APM 2.5 本身耗电较少（约 200mA），能提供 300–500mA 的电源即可留有充足余量。但如果舵机或其他耗电设备与 APM "
"共用同一电源，则必须综合考虑这些设备的功耗需求，并留有足够余量以防止灾难性的「欠压断电」。例如，单个数字舵机根据尺寸和性能不同，可能轻松消耗 "
"1–5A。（注意：ESC 不会从 APM 消耗电源。）如果出现随机复位或其他异常行为，最可能是由于 APM "
"供电噪声大或电源不足。与所有逻辑板一样，电机、舵机或其他大电流设备在电源上产生的电气噪声可能导致不可预测的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:414
#: 3f131a8ebb674639bb2f4874316df6b5 6cebbfcd2aa542d99a4a7e33b06d8e8f
#: 9b8acb523391494b804f7934d688e5ad ddecb73da2b541bdb7b780cdd1f71784
#: dfd4b20fffa6492e8235c2bbcbf310bf
msgid ""
"It is recommend that a \\ `power filter <http://www.dpcav.com/xcart/Power-"
"Supply-Filter-L-C-Type.html>`__ be used in such conditions."
msgstr ""
"在此类情况下，建议使用\\ `电源滤波器 <http://www.dpcav.com/xcart/Power-Supply-Filter-L-C-"
"Type.html>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:417
#: 145aca46355249018847da59da1370eb 471735a0812d416f8d648fe4644ed9dd
#: 5c1243074d894e40bf987fac414c8c05 b6f09ec6d0f047169917656bb4a6ce90
#: fe7907fdf9bb49a989a161e483eea178
msgid ""
"Too short or long power wires, bad or old connectors, or insufficient "
"current capability of the APM power source can result in a \"brown-out\" "
"situation resulting in unpredictable operation. This is particularly true in"
" traditional helicopters where the collective servos can draw 3-20 amps in "
"short bursts. The power source must be able to accommodate this without "
"voltage droop or voltage spikes. A quality switching type BEC (e.g one of "
"`these <http://www.castlecreations.com/products-search?qs=bec>`__ or one of "
"`these <http://www.western-robotics.com/WRL-HBECM2>`__) can be a solution "
"depending on overall current requirements. Many of these type of regulators "
"are programmable so remember to program them with in the safe operating "
"range of the APM2. Linear voltage regulators are not recommended as they are"
" inefficient and prone to overheating and heat induced failures. APM2 should"
" never be connected directly to a battery of any type."
msgstr ""
"电源线过短或过长、接插件劣质或老化、APM 供电电流能力不足，都可能造成\"电压跌落（brown-"
"out）\"，导致不可预测的行为。传统直升机尤其如此：总距舵机的短时电流可达 3-20 安培。电源必须能承受而不出现压降或电压尖峰。优质的开关型 "
"BEC（例如 `这些 <http://www.castlecreations.com/products-search?qs=bec>`__ 或 `这些 "
"<http://www.western-robotics.com/WRL-"
"HBECM2>`__）视总电流需求可作为一种方案。这类稳压器很多是可编程的，记得把它们编程在 APM2 "
"的安全工作范围内。不推荐线性稳压器：效率低、易过热并出现热致失效。任何类型的电池都绝不能直接接到 APM2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:433
#: 225ee592a57744a2a055a0bd3b7e3ae3 5e7d2df8539a459991c76cd107f2b721
#: 8b7ad286607a4ef085c6c78ba8c62011 b4bd0b11947b49cb9cbdd4a1e7f1b4a1
#: e8d39262081f4c868d65357880777506
msgid ""
"Power source problems are common and can be insidious and frustrating. Be "
"meticulous. Any autopilot or autopilot is useless and potentially dangerous "
"without good clean power source."
msgstr "电源问题较为常见，且往往难以察觉，令人沮丧。请务必细心处理。没有良好、清洁的电源，任何飞控或飞控都是无用甚至危险的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-powering-the-apm2.rst:437
#: 21070e49e5bc4e75bec301b7e44952f8 61c5810ee9b647a48c0bb5cd757a00ce
#: 634f0b1ac35c4e61b8d821596db6eda8 9f931195d54549f481b7e3fb8e6d3605
#: c8d65fe4f9d24444ae1245f248ebe65a
msgid ""
"The picture below is of APM 2; but the concept is applicable to APM 2.5/2.6."
msgstr "下图为 APM 2 的示例，但概念同样适用于 APM 2.5/2.6。"
